>  Why is it that when i die while trying to rob a store and play another 
>  games and get that bone level ,the shopkeeper keeps killing me? The stairway

When you die in the shop with unpaid items in your inventory, the shopkeeper
remembers your name, and that you had something you hadn't paid for. When he
seees you next time (on another game), of course he is claiming for what belongs
to him. However, if it is somebody else coming to your bones, he just says he
was looking for you.. the message like the one I wrote just a few lines ago.
You may enter the same bones level safely when you use another name.
